SUMMARY:Saturday Sanctuary: Create Space for Intuitive Exploration
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nDiscover a welcoming space where spiritua
 l seekers and practitioners come together to share insight\, energy\, and 
 meaningful experiences. Whether you're seeking guidance\, relaxation\, or 
 a sense of community\, this event offers something special for everyone.\n
 \n✨ **What Awaits You:**\nOn the First Saturday of every month\, intuiti
 ve practitioners gather to offer their unique gifts and services. You'll f
 ind tarot readings\, astrology readings\, SoulCollage®\, psychic mediumsh
 ip\, and energy healing services.\n\n✨ **While You’re Here:**\n\n* Enj
 oy our cozy seating area\, sip some tea and browse through oracle cards an
 d books from our Lightworker Library.\n* Connect with skilled practitioner
 s and other like-minded individuals.\n\nWhether you’re seeking insight\,
  connection\, or a peaceful moment of reflection\, Saturday Sanctuary is h
 ere to support you on your journey.\n\n**Where:** Sanctuary Studio\, just 
 7 minutes from downtown Asheville.\n**When:** First Saturdays of the month
  from 12 - 3 PM\n\nCome as you are and see where your intuition leads. We 
 look forward to welcoming you! ✨\n\nPlease text Marian at 828-707-1269\,
  or check out her website https://www.energeticexperiences.co/ to learn mo
 re.\n\nThis event is hosted by Marian Noble of Energetic Experiences. She 
 offers [private tarot readings](https://energeticexperiences.co/tarot) in 
 person\, online\, and by phone.
