SUMMARY:✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong Meditation✨
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Sunday October 4th 2:00-3:30 PM at Quie
 tude Sanctuary\, Black Mountain**\nJoin astrologer and sound practitioner 
 **David Heiss of Star Sounds** for a nourishing Sunday afternoon designed 
 to help you align with the rhythms of the cosmos while settling deeply int
 o stillness\, presence\, and restoration.\nEach gathering begins with a **
 20-minute Astrology Transmission**\, exploring the current planetary trans
 its and the deeper themes moving through the collective and our personal l
 ives. Through an evolutionary and soul-centered lens\, David offers practi
 cal and inspiring insights to help you consciously navigate the energies o
 f the week ahead.\nFrom there\, participants will be guided into a **45-mi
 nute Gong Sound Journey**. Surrounded by the resonant tones of planetary g
 ongs\, singing bowls\, and sacred sound instruments\, you'll be invited in
 to a meditative state where the thinking mind can soften\, the nervous sys
 tem can unwind\, and a deeper connection to Self can emerge.\nWhether you 
 are seeking relaxation\, spiritual insight\, emotional renewal\, or simply
  a quiet place to rest and reconnect\, this weekly experience offers a sac
 red pause from the busyness of everyday life.\n\n**🙏Donations Start at 
 $33-Please give more if you can. If $33 is to much\, just email David at [
 [david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love)]([mailto:david@stars
 ounds.love](http://mailto:david@starsounds.love)) for a special price🙏*
 *\n\n👤 **About David Heiss**\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutionary Astrolog
 er and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding himself and others into deeper
  self-awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he has
  worked with the transformative power of **gongs and astrology**\, followi
 ng a profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path of healing and
  inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** (un
 derstanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vibrational
  experience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **remember who the
 y are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: to help y
 ou **experience yourself more fully**.\n**🧘‍♂️Please bring your o
 wn "sound healing nest"** including blankets\, pillows\, bolsters\, or any
  other comforts that will support you in resting deeply during the journey
 . **Yoga mats are provided by Quietude.**\nCome settle into stillness\, at
 tune to the wisdom of the heavens\, and allow the medicine of sound to car
 ry you home to yourself.\n*"As above\, so within."*
