SUMMARY:QHHT : Past Life Regression Introduction
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**An Introduction to QHHT: Exploring the 
 Subconscious**\n\n**Curious about Quantum Healing Hypnosis Technique (QHHT
 )? Join me for a relaxed\, 45-minute introduction to this approach to guid
 ed hypnosis\,** **pastlife** **regression\, and personal exploration.**\n\
 n**We’ll talk about what a QHHT session involves\, how people prepare\, 
 and the kinds of questions they may choose to bring. I’ll also explain w
 hat the experience can feel like and leave time for your questions.**\n\n*
 *No experience with hypnosis is needed. Come with curiosity and any questi
 ons you have. This is an informational gathering\; we won’t conduct indi
 vidual QHHT sessions during the event.**
